---
// Signal Protocol Double Ratchet Algorithm (Root Ratchet + KDF Chains) Diagram Component
---

<figure class="dra-diag" aria-labelledby="dra-diag-caption">
  <!-- Desktop SVG Layout -->
  <svg
    class="dra-diag__desktop"
    viewBox="0 0 880 340"
    role="img"
    aria-labelledby="dra-diag-title dra-diag-desc"
  >
    <title id="dra-diag-title">
      Signal 雙棘輪演算法（Root Ratchet ＋ KDF Chains）架構圖
    </title>
    <desc id="dra-diag-desc">
      展示根棘輪隨 DH 交換旋轉，派生發送鏈與接收鏈，每條訊息生成獨立 Message Key
      並在用完後立即銷毀。
    </desc>

    <defs>
      <marker
        id="dra-arrow-blue"
        viewBox="0 0 10 10"
        refX="8"
        refY="5"
        markerWidth="7"
        markerHeight="7"
        orient="auto"
      >
        <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" class="dra-diag__arrow-head--blue"
        ></path>
      </marker>
      <marker
        id="dra-arrow-green"
        viewBox="0 0 10 10"
        refX="8"
        refY="5"
        markerWidth="7"
        markerHeight="7"
        orient="auto"
      >
        <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" class="dra-diag__arrow-head--green"
        ></path>
      </marker>
    </defs>

    <!-- Outer Card Background -->
    <rect
      x="25"
      y="15"
      width="830"
      height="310"
      rx="12"
      class="dra-diag__card-bg"></rect>

    <!-- Top: Root KDF Ratchet (x: 270, width: 340) -->
    <g transform="translate(270, 30)">
      <rect
        width="340"
        height="60"
        rx="8"
        class="dra-diag__box dra-diag__box--purple"></rect>
      <text
        x="170"
        y="26"
        class="dra-diag__title dra-diag__title--purple"
        text-anchor="middle"
      >
        根棘輪 (Root KDF Ratchet)
      </text>
      <text x="170" y="46" class="dra-diag__desc" text-anchor="middle">
        隨雙方角色輪換與非對稱 DH 交換持續注入新熵
      </text>
    </g>

    <!-- Diverging Arrows to Sending & Receiving Chains -->
    <path
      d="M 370 90 L 220 125"
      class="dra-diag__path dra-diag__path--blue"
      marker-end="url(#dra-arrow-blue)"></path>
    <text x="250" y="105" class="dra-diag__edge-tag dra-diag__edge-tag--blue"
      >派生發送鏈金鑰</text
    >

    <path
      d="M 510 90 L 660 125"
      class="dra-diag__path dra-diag__path--green"
      marker-end="url(#dra-arrow-green)"></path>
    <text x="630" y="105" class="dra-diag__edge-tag dra-diag__edge-tag--green"
      >派生接收鏈金鑰</text
    >

    <!-- Left Box: Sending Chain Ratchet (x: 50, y: 130, width: 355) -->
    <g transform="translate(50, 130)">
      <rect
        width="355"
        height="175"
        rx="8"
        class="dra-diag__box dra-diag__box--blue"></rect>
      <text
        x="177"
        y="26"
        class="dra-diag__title dra-diag__title--blue"
        text-anchor="middle"
      >
        發送鏈對稱棘輪 (Sending Chain)
      </text>
      <text x="177" y="44" class="dra-diag__desc" text-anchor="middle">
        KDF 單向步進 ➔ 保證前向保密 (PFS)
      </text>

      <!-- Key 1 -->
      <rect x="25" y="58" width="305" height="30" rx="4" class="dra-diag__pill"
      ></rect>
      <text x="40" y="77" class="dra-diag__key-text">🔑 Message Key #1</text>
      <text x="315" y="77" class="dra-diag__burn-tag" text-anchor="end"
        >[用畢即抹除 🔥]</text
      >

      <!-- Key 2 -->
      <rect x="25" y="96" width="305" height="30" rx="4" class="dra-diag__pill"
      ></rect>
      <text x="40" y="115" class="dra-diag__key-text">🔑 Message Key #2</text>
      <text x="315" y="115" class="dra-diag__burn-tag" text-anchor="end"
        >[用畢即抹除 🔥]</text
      >

      <!-- Step text -->
      <text x="177" y="152" class="dra-diag__sub-note" text-anchor="middle">
        每發出一條訊息，齒輪滾動一步，舊密鑰絕不可逆
      </text>
    </g>

    <!-- Right Box: Receiving Chain Ratchet (x: 475, y: 130, width: 355) -->
    <g transform="translate(475, 130)">
      <rect
        width="355"
        height="175"
        rx="8"
        class="dra-diag__box dra-diag__box--green"></rect>
      <text
        x="177"
        y="26"
        class="dra-diag__title dra-diag__title--green"
        text-anchor="middle"
      >
        接收鏈對稱棘輪 (Receiving Chain)
      </text>
      <text x="177" y="44" class="dra-diag__desc" text-anchor="middle">
        非對稱 DH 交換 ➔ 提供後向自癒 (PCS)
      </text>

      <!-- Key 1 -->
      <rect x="25" y="58" width="305" height="30" rx="4" class="dra-diag__pill"
      ></rect>
      <text x="40" y="77" class="dra-diag__key-text">🔓 解密 Key #1</text>
      <text x="315" y="77" class="dra-diag__burn-tag" text-anchor="end"
        >[解密後銷毀 🔥]</text
      >

      <!-- Key 2 -->
      <rect x="25" y="96" width="305" height="30" rx="4" class="dra-diag__pill"
      ></rect>
      <text x="40" y="115" class="dra-diag__key-text">🔓 解密 Key #2</text>
      <text x="315" y="115" class="dra-diag__burn-tag" text-anchor="end"
        >[解密後銷毀 🔥]</text
      >

      <!-- Step text -->
      <text x="177" y="152" class="dra-diag__sub-note" text-anchor="middle">
        收到對方回覆時觸發 DH Ratchet 步進，刷新共享密鑰
      </text>
    </g>
  </svg>

  <!-- Mobile View (Vertical Cards) -->
  <div class="dra-diag__mobile">
    <div class="dra-mobile-card dra-mobile-card--purple">
      <span class="dra-mobile-badge dra-mobile-badge--purple">ROOT RATCHET</span
      >
      <h4>1. 根棘輪 (Root KDF Ratchet)</h4>
      <p>
        隨雙方通訊角色輪換（Alice 發言換 Bob 發言）進行非對稱 Diffie-Hellman
        交換，持續注入不可預測的新隨機熵。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="dra-mobile-arrow">▼ 派生兩側單向對稱鏈</div>

    <div class="dra-mobile-card dra-mobile-card--blue">
      <span class="dra-mobile-badge dra-mobile-badge--blue">SENDING CHAIN</span>
      <h4>2. 發送鏈棘輪（每訊息一密鑰）</h4>
      <p>
        每發送一條訊息，KDF 單向步進產出獨一無二的 <code>Message Key</code
        >。訊息加密發出後，密鑰立即在記憶體徹底銷毀（實現 PFS 前向保密）。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="dra-mobile-card dra-mobile-card--green">
      <span class="dra-mobile-badge dra-mobile-badge--green"
        >RECEIVING CHAIN</span
      >
      <h4>3. 接收鏈棘輪（解密即銷毀）</h4>
      <p>
        接收端對齊序號計算出對應解密密鑰，解密完成立即抹除。當收到對方新公鑰時推動
        DH 棘輪，自動修復遭受短暫監聽的會話（實現 PCS 後向安全）。
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <figcaption id="dra-diag-caption" class="dra-diag__caption">
    圖二：Signal 雙棘輪演算法（Root Ratchet ＋ KDF Chains）架構運作原理
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .dra-diag {
    margin: 2.5rem 0;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .dra-diag__desktop {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }

  .dra-diag__mobile {
    display: none;
  }

  .dra-diag__caption {
    margin-top: 0.875rem;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: var(--dg-muted, #8b949e);
    text-align: center;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  /* SVG Theme Token Styles */
  .dra-diag__card-bg {
    fill: var(--dg-surface, #161b22);
    stroke: var(--dg-rule, #30363d);
    stroke-width: 1.5px;
  }

  .dra-diag__box {
    stroke-width: 1.5px;
  }

  .dra-diag__box--purple {
    fill: var(--dg-surface-2, #241b35);
    stroke: #bc8cff;
  }

  .dra-diag__box--blue {
    fill: var(--dg-surface-2, #1f242c);
    stroke: #388bfd;
  }

  .dra-diag__box--green {
    fill: var(--dg-surface-2, #1b2e23);
    stroke: #238636;
  }

  .dra-diag__title {
    font-family:
      system-ui,
      -apple-system,
      sans-serif;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .dra-diag__title--purple {
    fill: #d2a8ff;
  }

  .dra-diag__title--blue {
    fill: #58a6ff;
  }

  .dra-diag__title--green {
    fill: #3fb950;
  }

  .dra-diag__desc {
    font-family:
      system-ui,
      -apple-system,
      sans-serif;
    font-size: 11px;
    fill: var(--dg-ink-2, #8b949e);
  }

  .dra-diag__path {
    fill: none;
    stroke-width: 2px;
  }

  .dra-diag__path--blue {
    stroke: #388bfd;
  }

  .dra-diag__path--green {
    stroke: #238636;
  }

  .dra-diag__arrow-head--blue {
    fill: #388bfd;
  }

  .dra-diag__arrow-head--green {
    fill: #238636;
  }

  .dra-diag__edge-tag {
    font-family:
      system-ui,
      -apple-system,
      sans-serif;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .dra-diag__edge-tag--blue {
    fill: #58a6ff;
  }

  .dra-diag__edge-tag--green {
    fill: #3fb950;
  }

  .dra-diag__pill {
    fill: var(--dg-surface, #10141a);
    stroke: var(--dg-rule, #30363d);
    stroke-width: 1px;
  }

  .dra-diag__key-text {
    font-family:
      ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, monospace;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    fill: var(--dg-ink, #f0f6fc);
  }

  .dra-diag__burn-tag {
    font-family:
      system-ui,
      -apple-system,
      sans-serif;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    fill: #f85149;
  }

  .dra-diag__sub-note {
    font-family:
      system-ui,
      -apple-system,
      sans-serif;
    font-size: 11px;
    fill: var(--dg-ink-2, #8b949e);
  }

  /* Light Theme Adjustments */
  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .dra-diag__card-bg {
    fill: var(--dg-surface, #ffffff);
    stroke: var(--dg-rule, #d0d7de);
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .dra-diag__box--purple {
    fill: #fbefff;
    stroke: #8250df;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .dra-diag__box--blue {
    fill: #eff7ff;
    stroke: #0969da;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .dra-diag__box--green {
    fill: #dafbe1;
    stroke: #1a7f37;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .dra-diag__title--purple {
    fill: #8250df;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .dra-diag__title--blue {
    fill: #0969da;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .dra-diag__title--green {
    fill: #1a7f37;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .dra-diag__path--blue {
    stroke: #0969da;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .dra-diag__path--green {
    stroke: #1a7f37;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .dra-diag__arrow-head--blue {
    fill: #0969da;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .dra-diag__arrow-head--green {
    fill: #1a7f37;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .dra-diag__edge-tag--blue {
    fill: #0969da;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .dra-diag__edge-tag--green {
    fill: #1a7f37;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .dra-diag__pill {
    fill: #ffffff;
    stroke: var(--dg-rule, #d0d7de);
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .dra-diag__key-text {
    fill: var(--dg-ink, #24292f);
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .dra-diag__burn-tag {
    fill: #cf222e;
  }

  /* Mobile Responsive View */
  @media (max-width: 48rem) {
    .dra-diag__desktop {
      display: none !important;
    }

    .dra-diag__mobile {
      display: flex !important;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }

    .dra-mobile-card {
      padding: 1rem 1.125rem;
      border-radius: 0.5rem;
      border: 1px solid var(--dg-rule, #30363d);
      background: var(--dg-surface, #161b22);
    }

    .dra-mobile-card--purple {
      border-color: #bc8cff;
      background: rgba(188, 140, 255, 0.05);
    }

    .dra-mobile-card--blue {
      border-color: #388bfd;
      background: rgba(56, 139, 253, 0.05);
    }

    .dra-mobile-card--green {
      border-color: #238636;
      background: rgba(35, 134, 54, 0.05);
    }

    .dra-mobile-badge {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 0.125rem 0.4rem;
      border-radius: 0.25rem;
      font-size: 0.6875rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      margin-bottom: 0.375rem;
    }

    .dra-mobile-badge--purple {
      background: rgba(188, 140, 255, 0.2);
      color: #d2a8ff;
    }

    .dra-mobile-badge--blue {
      background: rgba(56, 139, 253, 0.2);
      color: #58a6ff;
    }

    .dra-mobile-badge--green {
      background: rgba(35, 134, 54, 0.2);
      color: #3fb950;
    }

    .dra-mobile-card h4 {
      margin: 0 0 0.375rem;
      font-size: 0.9375rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--dg-ink, #f0f6fc);
    }

    .dra-mobile-card p {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 0.8125rem;
      line-height: 1.5;
      color: var(--dg-ink-2, #8b949e);
    }

    .dra-mobile-card code {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      padding: 0.1rem 0.3rem;
      border-radius: 0.2rem;
      background: var(--dg-surface-2, #1f242c);
      color: var(--dg-ink, #f0f6fc);
    }

    .dra-mobile-arrow {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--dg-muted, #8b949e);
    }
  }
</style>
